  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e4c148edbf41ac9488b3d41644c00249, type: 3}
  m_Name: Valmir(Thalmor)_RequestforGettingTheThing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  poemFont: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7c0c8e4bba7f8e14d923c4b8dba73c35, type: 2}
  poemText: 'Dear Kodlak,


    My name is Valmir Adwatch, and I am petitioning the
    Companions to aid me in my hour of need.


    Within the ancient ruin of Forelhost
    lies a great cohort of evil and ancient dragon cultists. For a long time, they
    were content to remain in their cold fortress of the dead, but recently they
    have spilt out into the surrounding Rift, causing strife for all who live here-
    including myself.


    From my understanding, this is a result of the dragon
    priest who lives there reawakening in response to the return of his old masters.
    So, if one of the mighty Companions could slay this dragon priest, peace would
    return to our land.


    To prove the deed is done, give me the mask of the
    dragon priest. I will be waiting at my homestead, Snow-Shod Farm.


    I am
    willing to part with 2,000 gold pieces to see it done.'
